<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA BEAT NEW ZEALAND BY EIGHT WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA BEAT NEW ZEALAND BY EIGHT WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>BANGALORE, India 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>India beat New Zealand by eight wickets in their Independence Cup cricket match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 220-9 in 50 overs; India 221-2 in  42.3 overs.</p>
</text>
